          deckDescription: 'One or more standard 52-card decks plus Jokers; typically two or three decks so each player receives five cards and Jokers act as wilds or movement cards. Pegs and Jokers is a board-and-card hybrid where cards drive peg movement.',
          suitDescription: 'The four French suits (hearts, diamonds, clubs, spades) and Jokers. In Pegs and Jokers, card plays move pegs along the board; Jokers have special movement or wild effects; suit may determine direction or value.',
